  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Logic :** (1st number + 3rd number) = (2nd number ÷ 6)\n\n**Given : **\n\n \n• (10, 300, 40)\n\n10 + 40 = 300 ÷ 6\n\n50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (12, 192, 20)\n\n12 + 20 = 192 ÷ 6\n\n32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (16, 226, 30)\n\n16 + 30 = 226 ÷ 6\n\n**46** ≠ **37.7 (LHS** ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (17, 156, 12)\n\n17 + 12 = 156 ÷ 6\n\n**29** ≠ **26** (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (20, 160, 10)\n\n20 + 10 = 160 ÷ 6\n\n**30** ≠ **26**.7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (18, 228, 20)\n\n18 + 20 = 228 ÷ 6\n\n**38 = 38 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (4)\"** is the correct answer.",
